---
title: "United States History Since 1865"
code: "HIS-122"
category: "history"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces the history of the United States from 1865 to present. Includes major political, social and economic developments since 1865, overseas expansion, the two world wars, the Cold War and the post-Cold War era. This is a Passport Transfer course. Lecture 3 hours per week.
